  "bodyHash": "141d49abd77d2ee4",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Forge？<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-keybinding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">《Modern KeyBinding》的官方移植版本。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em><strong>对于普通玩家：</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em><strong>功能特性</strong></em></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em>现在可以使用按键修饰符来定义绑定键的激活键。例如“Ctrl + G”或“Alt + S”；</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em>具有相同激活键但不同按键冲突上下文的绑定键现在不会再互相冲突。</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em>“无冲突按键”（默认关闭）：当按下该键时，所有使用相同按键的绑定键都将同时激活。</em></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>配置说明</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"># ModernKeyBinding-Config</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> # “无冲突按键”功能。设为 true 以启用。[默认值：false] </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">nonConflictKeys=false</span></p>\n<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>对于开发者：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本模组的 Wiki（<a href=\"https://github.com/Nova-Committee/ModernKeyBinding/blob/Forge/1.7.10/README.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">英文</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://wiki.nova-committee.cn/project-1/doc-10/\" rel=\"nofollow\">简体中文</a>）。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>注意：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>完全可以</strong></span>&nbsp;将该模组添加到你的整合包中；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">请访问 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flegacyfabric.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">legacyfabric.net</a> 了解更多关于 Legacyfabric 的信息。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
